# Lyra wakes up captive in the Observatory (Milestone 20c, escape start).
# Plays once, the first time the Observatory loads on Lyra's game.

wait 0.6
emote player ...
narrate Cold starlight through a cracked dome. The great brass lens hangs crooked, pointed at nothing.
face player left
wait 0.4
face player right
wait 0.4
face player down
say Lyra: The star charts... someone has scratched through every constellation. The whole sky, crossed out.
say Lyra: They took my focus stone but left me my spells. Whoever they are, they don't understand magic very well.
narrate From deeper in the halls comes a muffled voice, calling for help.
